      "content": "wait really?? you're saying it's actually happening? i thought i was just being paranoid. how would they even hide it from the privacy terms? like if they're using it for psychological profiling, they'd have to be doing it so quietly that nobody notices. do you think they're using the gait data to detect stuff like stress levels or anxiety to target ads at people when they're vulnerable?",
